<title>UK: Cargill sets $200 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Cargill sets $200 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CARGILL</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.25 PCT  MATURITY    13.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.242   PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    100.067   SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LON	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC   1.275</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT FEB 2000 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
